  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一切都是白色的。\n頭頂的天空與腳下的地面，目所能及之處，全都被安靜的白色填滿。\n純白、寂靜、空無一物。\n只有火苗搖曳燃燒。\n從某一個時間點起，悄然侵蝕夢境，又於夢醒時融化消弭。\n“這裡是哪裡？”\n無人應答。\n“我為什麼會在這裡？”\n無人應答。\n“我該怎麼離開？”\n無人應答。\n“......”\n除了自己之外，誰都不在。\n除了自己之外，什麼都沒有。\n那麼，\n所有的困惑就只剩下一個——\n“你......是什麼？”\n......\n............"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "02:35 P.M.  天氣/陰轉小雨\n羅德島艦船，二號艙室，幹員生活區"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "......呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "（又來了。怎麼老做那個夢，那到底什麼玩意啊。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "（呃，頭都睡扁了，好痛。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "（抓頭）煩死了，都是博士那傢伙害的，這些題目也太難寫了吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "這什麼怪題目啊，還要求面積？搞什麼啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "哇啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "停停停停。不是現在，別燒起來啊喂！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "唔呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "還是把桌角烤焦了......算了，還好作業沒事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "博士那傢伙......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "喂， 這些一定要都寫完嗎？真麻煩......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "啊？學起來對我有好處？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "廢話，這我當然知道，要不然誰要跟你學！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "但是作業也太多了吧！而且這個詞和這個詞有什麼區別啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "就因為我講了你兩句，赫默還拿走了我的辣椒乾，這都怪你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "喂，你還笑？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我知道她藏辣椒乾的地方。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "真的？！在哪？！",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "真要跟你一起拿了，你和我肯定都會挨駡。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "別一直笑啊，又不說話，很奇怪呀！",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "你是不是壓根就不想回答我啊？",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "炭烤沙蟲腿，來一根？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "呃，博士，這是什麼？",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "拿走拿走，我不要！——唔唔唔？",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "唔？",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "（咀嚼）呃。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "（吞咽）咕嘟......啊？",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "我，我吃了什麼？",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "算了......",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "對了，博士，赫默明天是不是要去出任務？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "帶上我一起，怎麼樣？我的實力，你知道的對吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "你去和她說說，讓我也去看看吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這次行動是收尾，你更擅長戰鬥吧？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "搞什麼，你說的那些我也會啊？",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "那為什麼我們現在沒得戰鬥，讓我去啊，我一定要給其他人看看我的實力！",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "這個月投訴有點多，先忍忍吧？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "我這能燒乾整個戰場的火力，他們就是做不到才嫉妒我吧！",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "我才不管那些人怎麼說呢！",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "赫默和你總該相信我吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "其他人不能理解，我沒關係，又不關我的事，",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "但為什麼連你們也這麼說！為什麼呀！",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "伊芙利特，冷靜！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "咳！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "煩死了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "算了，去他的。我看看，這題這題還有這題......都填C。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "還有這題......看不太懂，算了隨便寫寫。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "這樣就搞定了......！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
          "text": "到做檢查的時間了，伊芙利特。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "呃。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "煩人的傢伙來了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
          "text": "怎麼一股燒著了的味道......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
          "text": "伊芙利特？打擾一下。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
          "text": "今天要做一個血液源石結晶密度檢查，請你配合......嗯？這桌子是怎麼回事，怎麼被燒焦了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "沒什麼。就是個意外。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
          "text": "伊芙利特......這樣很危險的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
          "text": "羅德島內部是不允許出現明火的，如果是你的話，更要好好控制。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
          "text": "我跟他們說了，不可以用抑制類的藥物，但也需要你好好配合......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "囉嗦死了。煩不煩啊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
          "text": "......伊芙利特，我只是個普通的護士，我不太會帶孩子，",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
          "text": "如果可以的話，我們能好好交流......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "誰又是孩子了，你好煩啊？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "為什麼我要攤上你這種人，就不能讓我一個人待著嗎？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
          "text": "伊芙利特......我也有自己的工作的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "那就別管我的事！說過好多次了，那些穿著白大褂的，我看見就難受！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "快讓開，別擋著我出門。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
          "text": "可是，檢查......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "我叫你別擋路！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "啊！！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "我，我的作業！燒，燒起來了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "你搞什麼，搞什麼啊？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
          "text": "伊芙利特！快，快滅火！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "都說了，讓我一個人待著！！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "你怎麼賠我！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
          "text": "不行，不行！我去叫夜鶯小姐，請等一下！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "......不，不行。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "我又做了什麼啊，可惡......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "哎，作業！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "嗯......破破爛爛的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "（赫默也不肯帶上我。可惡，明明我那麼強！）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "（現在博士也出去了，就只剩下那些討人厭的白大褂......）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "（真煩，這麼怕我的話乾脆就離我遠點啊。）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "（本子......稍稍燒焦了一點，不過還行吧？）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "（算了，總之先把練習題放到博士的辦公桌上，應該就OK了？）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "有什麼事？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅",
          "text": "！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "你這樣行動，一般幹員會被嚇到的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅",
          "text": "我只是在走路。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "一般幹員是不會在牆面上走路的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅",
          "text": "？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "算了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "你手上拿的是......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅",
          "text": "是作業。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅",
          "text": "麻煩。但凱爾希說，這要聽博士的。紅沒得選。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅",
          "text": "這裡你懂嗎？這個詞彙。紅不理解。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "你居然會......居然會問我問題。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅",
          "text": "你不會嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "我試試好了，就先讓我看看吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "這個詞，嗯，也不是很難理解。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "......大概就是這樣。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "這樣說，能懂嗎？我怕我講得不好。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅",
          "text": "可以。很清楚。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "那就好。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "不過，你其實也可以直接問博士？博士的解答，肯定比我的更準確。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅",
          "text": "也可以。但紅覺得和霜葉說話輕鬆。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "......這樣。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "你們堵在這幹什麼呢！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "咦，這不是小紅帽嗎？真神奇，你居然沒直接出現在課堂上......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅",
          "text": "——伊芙利特。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "伊芙利特，別那麼靠近她。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "紅她有很強的防範意識，會下意識地反應，別被傷到。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅",
          "text": "防範意識？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "靠近你五釐米的東西會怎麼樣？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅",
          "text": "紅切掉。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "你看。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "哈......你這個冰塊臉還挺瞭解她的嘛？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "幹員手冊我是有好好請教杜賓老師的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "不過紅，對別的幹員，可以稍微放輕鬆一些嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅",
          "text": "？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "算了......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "噗，哈哈哈哈。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅",
          "text": "很好笑？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "唉？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "紅，她不是這個意思。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "嘖。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "嗯......？你藏在背後的是什麼？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "啊？哦，是，是作業啦。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "本伊芙利特大人可是輕輕鬆鬆做完了啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "是嗎......嗯，那就好。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅",
          "text": "紅聞到了燒焦的味道。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅",
          "text": "伊芙利特，作業燒了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "我不是有意的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅",
          "text": "哦。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "......你是不是覺得我沒完成作業，用火燒掉了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅",
          "text": "紅不知道。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "想說就說啊，別這樣說話。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅",
          "text": "？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "別，伊芙利特，紅是真的不太會說......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅",
          "text": "你生氣了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "煩死了，好討厭啊。我為什麼要和你一起上課啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "今天怎麼搞的，真是煩透了......怎麼這麼不走運啊我。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "冷靜點，伊芙利特。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "我能感覺到周圍的溫度在升高，這很危險。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "......啊？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "你懂什麼啊？我好得很，別用那種好像什麼都知道一樣的語氣和我說話！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅",
          "text": "威脅？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "紅，別會錯意！她只是習慣了這麼說話！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "怪物。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "呃。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅",
          "text": "明白。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "你哪裡明白了......？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "怪物。\n傷害別人的怪物。燒掉一切的怪物。克制不住自己的怪物。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "我，很痛，很痛啊......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "怪物。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅",
          "text": "你要著火了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "等一下，伊芙利特......不是現在。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "關你們什麼事？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "怪物。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "你們又懂我哪些了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "怪物。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "快住手！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅",
          "text": "她威脅我。不，她威脅到了羅德島。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "不要動手，紅！她只是一時發熱！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "你們兩個——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "誰發熱了？你是不是想說我頭腦發熱？我清醒得很！你那點冷氣根本就沒用，快走開，你也想被燒成灰嗎！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "不要。不行。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅",
          "text": "控制不了自己。很弱。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "小紅帽，你會被烤焦！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "怪物。\n不，不可以，那些是朋友。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "text": "別！伊芙利特！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "怪物！\n不！我不是！！\n火焰在燃燒。\n火焰在瘋狂地燃燒。\n巨大的怪物咯咯直笑。\n白色的房間被燒的又黑又焦。\n有人在哭，有人在跑。\n哎呀，這是哪裡呢？\n有人走了過來，好熟悉，好高......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "不要......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "塞......救......大家......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "哎呀，哎呀哎呀，大家這是在做什麼呢。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "伊芙芙？在走廊上點火可不行哦。塞雷婭知道了會生氣的。當然，赫默也是。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "去......！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "不，不是......你不是......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "水分子的集群，去讓火焰安靜下來吧......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "噗哈——這水也太冰了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "哎......繆繆？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "繆繆，幫幫我......我不想......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "噓——可不要告訴其他人我來玩哦。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "沒問題！就交給我吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "呵呵，看到你還是這麼有精神，我就放心啦。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "不過，要好好遵守我們之間約定哦，伊芙芙？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "粗暴。\n肆意。\n橫行。\n總是在破壞。\n......\n我自己其實也是知道的。\n會痛的實驗讓人討厭。\n那些白大褂的目光讓人討厭。\n這 片 大 地 讓 人 討 厭。\n說什麼人生。\n說什麼未來。\n只要我放一把火，只要火燒得夠旺，所有那些用討厭眼神看著我的人，那些白色的牆壁和刺鼻的消毒水，所有所有，全都會消失在火中。\n只要我喜歡的人還在就好了。\n其他人怎麼樣關我什麼事？\n——在來到這裡之前，我一直是這麼想的。\n我一直覺得自己是這麼想的。\n但是現在不一樣了。\n粗暴。\n哎我當然知道。\n肆意。\n行啦我會小心點的。\n橫行。\n......也沒那麼嚴重吧？\n總是在破壞。\n我也不想的啊！\n我又不是不明白，很多事情誰想這樣啊。\n但至少，哼......\n你們說的，我有照著去做。\n我可不能燒掉羅德島和作業。\n還有朋友，哼......我的朋友也一定要像我一樣了不起呀！\n所以，沒事的。我努力的還不夠。我還要更加努力！\n看好了，我絕對要讓你們大吃一驚！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "哼！！",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "一下子毀了一整條走廊？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "才、才沒有！煩死了，不要你管！",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "唉......小紅帽她們呢，沒事吧......",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "你讓小紅帽躲開了？哼，算你識相。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "我有危險？大家都有危險？啊......",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "炭烤沙蟲腿，來一根？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "給我也來一根......不、不對！才不要吃啦！",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "我也......吃不下去呀。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "那個、走廊的事、唔呃、我也不是有意要破壞的......總之，對、對不起啦！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "可惡，怎麼會搞成這個樣子......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "對了，不是要檢查作業嗎？給你！",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這本本子，看起來飽經火灼啊。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "唉，嫌棄的話就別拿啊！",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "你能看出來這是什麼，對吧。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "交給你了，這就是我的作業。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "出了點小意外，變成這樣......喂，你那是什麼表情，你有什麼意見嗎！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "總之就是這樣！不管你信不信，反正我寫完了，我真的寫完了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "唔，頂、頂多就是撕壞了一點，被火燒了下，又被水澆了下。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "呃呃呃，還有瞎寫的題目多了點嘛，今後我會好好寫啦！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "我又搞砸了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "你要罵就罵吧。對不起。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "伊芙利特，把手伸出來。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "啊？搞什麼啊？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "喏。別打太狠哦！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "唔？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "這個是......乾脆鬼椒？我最喜歡的辣椒乾！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "欸、啊？是給我的？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "什麼啊......搞什麼啊！混蛋，我告訴你，可別以為區區這麼點零食，就能、就能......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "（大聲吸鼻子）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "哈，算你上道！雖然我還是覺得你們這些穿白大褂的傢伙有問題！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "你也就勉強算是個例外吧！（小聲）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "不過我可警告你！別總是和赫默一樣拿我當小孩子看！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "我真的會生氣的！生氣起來超——可怕的！",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你是個很優秀的幹員。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "呃、呃呃、突然說什麼啊，這不是理所當然的嗎！",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "很有氣勢啊，伊芙芙。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "噗——咳、咳咳咳。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
              "text": "誰告訴你這個稱呼，不對，誰、誰允許你這樣喊我的啊！",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "下一次行動，你也出動吧。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "！！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "真的假的？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "你的意思是下一次會讓我也一起去囉？是這個意思吧？啊？你可別騙我啊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "但是......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "但是什麼？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "欸你快說啊，不要讓我急啊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "心平氣和自己想？那是什麼，我不懂你在說......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "對了，得去道歉啊......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "那個每天來看我的姐姐，我不是有意嚇她的......我也不想對霜葉她們那麼凶......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "唉，博士，幫我個忙吧，你幫我去跟她們說吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "為什麼不自己去說呢？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你又嚇唬醫療幹員了？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "我......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "這次我肯定犯錯了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "雖然他們真的很煩人！但我確實不該那麼做的吧......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "我也不想你老因為這些事被別人說啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "下次我們去海邊玩的話，你要不要去？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "海邊？那是啥？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "啊無所謂，要去！我要去！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "呃，不，為什麼突然要帶我去玩？博士你有點奇怪......",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "因為你表現必須好一點，我才能說服赫默。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "切，什麼嘛，還是想讓我做這做那對吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "自己去道歉吧？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "哼，放心！包在我身上，不就是道個歉嘛！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "我們約好了對吧？你可不能反悔不帶我去哦！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "嘿嘿，海邊！嗯，聽起來就很有意思呢！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "博士！明天見！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "你是不是還在看？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "哼，我心裡清楚得很，那些人怎麼看我，怎麼想我。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "但這有什麼關係？我才不在乎，切，我才不要在乎。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "我一定會把你幹掉！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "知道嗎，就是你老害我丟臉，就是你老讓麻煩事纏上我！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "沒有我，你是什麼？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "哈，你以為我還像以前一樣怕你嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "老讓我那麼痛，老讓所有人都那麼痛......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "你這大胖子！傻瓜！肥胖火團！長角的熱氣球！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "呼呼，有意思。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "你看好了，以後我可不會再什麼都燒了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "我可是知道的，有東西能燒，有東西是不能的！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "沒有不能被焚燒的事物！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "什麼呀，我不願意！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "本伊芙利特大人不願意燒，那就是不能！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "那些擋著我的路的，我肯定一把火給他們全燒乾淨。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "但那些不能的，我是絕對不會動的！連一點火我都不會發出來！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "那我等著，小東西。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
          "text": "遲早有一天......一定！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
